ing changes in customer behavior and customer practices may impact the value of and demand for our products, including domain names and our websites.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-25-000023","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-20","proof":"77db0dde95c0447f2caf947aa21ff23e9ae7aaa53d6c2f4d3a56c5de83b4a0e9"},"GDDY.q.riskgone.2":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our business could be negatively impacted by shareholder activism.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-25-000023","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-20","proof":"08fdf24827416d6e6f88dfba6b3c67a241d7ffd32e2f4beb0292bcad98c60f7c"},"GDDY.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk","quote":"Our business could be affected by new laws, rules, regulations or court orders regarding the internet.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-26-000010","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-25","proof":"c6a8d9c901016b4ca88dae445f190a5676e8803c52d01d6428058e5c1dd2dc6e"},"GDDY.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our business could be affected by new governmental regulations regarding the Internet.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-25-000023","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-20","proof":"285df88f2cea1a6862d24d550833a8c1769f68afbdcb433941bf8e9e4f88f229"},"GDDY.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk","quote":"If we are unable to continue to increase sales to new and existing customers, our business and operating results would be harmed.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-26-000010","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-25","proof":"42ceb44f27a7fa09078384f2f92811ec65745dc43bbda18577042f2288de5c67"},"GDDY.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If we are unable to attract and retain customers and increase sales to new and existing customers, our business and operating results would be harmed.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-25-000023","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-20","proof":"d368f71e6ce5a58cdcd48caa7c304eedf87bde2b23c7b38440c8071b1c271a69"},"GDDY.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk","quote":"Our business is subject to evolving regulations and scrutiny from investors, regulators and other stakeholders relating to environmental, social and governance issues, which could result in additional costs for us and may adversely impact our reputation.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-26-000010","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-25","proof":"9d75daea75ea92f2acfd87f13e4ed4b9e2a2eeb6106d7d6a122294a8f864e2a1"},"GDDY.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Increased scrutiny from investors, regulators and other stakeholders relating to environmental, social and governance issues could result in additional costs for us and may adversely impact our reputation.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-25-000023","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-20","proof":"7f096dad5a65940903bd52e7ff8be02fc4ab898021bc0c8ec1dbbdc3d77de366"},"GDDY.q.riskrw.3":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk","quote":"We substantially rely upon AWS services to operate our integrated platform, and any disruption of or interference with our use of AWS would adversely affect our business, results of operations and financial condition.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-26-000010","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-25","proof":"c9193040d9a4781a184e6f055920b7176d97ec37e11b22a2974dba98b837da64"},"GDDY.q.riskrwwas.3":{"c":"GDDY","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We substantially rely upon AWS to operate our integrated platform, and any disruption of or interference with our use of AWS would adversely affect our business, results of operations and financial condition.","source":"GDDY-0001609711-25-000023","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-20","proof":"38b6b575200f6fdb8dd1f5c3f72fe504b3dd281124cbe3db7de9c69ed1da6224"}},"sources":{"GDDY-0001609711-25-000023":{"kind":"prior-annual-report","by":"GDDY","form":"10-K","period":"2024-12-31","date":"2025-02-20","accn":"0001609711-25-000023","title":"GoDaddy 10-K for the fiscal year ended 2024-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1609711/000160971125000023/gddy-20241231.htm","s